# November 19, 2026: southern and central Rensselaer County: the City of Rensselaer (old Greenbush and Bath), North
# Greenbush, Schodack, Nassau, Sand Lake, Poestenkill and Stephentown. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py (region renss).
# The earlier Rensselaer County batch (renss_osux) worked Hoosick, Pittstown, Schaghticoke and Brunswick; this one works
# the south and middle of the county. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py, and
# --rows for the county Register list), and through tools/page.py the NYS Parks Crailo page, HMdb marker pages, the Sand
# Lake Historical Society's marker and Faith Mills pages, the Town of Stephentown history page, the Rensselaer Land
# Trust waterfall page and the Arts Letters & Numbers contact page. NPGallery holds only placeholders for the Muitzes
# Kill, Schodack Landing, Nassau Church Street and DeFreest forms.
